      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.269,
          "end": 3.26,
          "en": "[Maximillian Schwarzmuller] So now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.26,
          "end": 6.24,
          "en": "we added the dose four pages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.24,
          "end": 9.14,
          "en": "It's now time to start filling them with some life.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.14,
          "end": 10.84,
          "en": "And it's of course up to you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 10.84,
          "end": 13.36,
          "en": "with which page you wanna start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.36,
          "end": 16.81,
          "en": "Now I'll start very classic with the starting page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.81,
          "end": 21.27,
          "en": "with the HomePage here, and I'll start populating that page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21.27,
          "end": 23.95,
          "en": "And on this HomePage, I wanna do two things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.95,
          "end": 26.75,
          "en": "I wanna output two things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.75,
          "end": 29.1,
          "en": "The first thing that should be rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.1,
          "end": 31.72,
          "en": "is like a Hero section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.72,
          "end": 33.94,
          "en": "And that's just how we typically call that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.94,
          "end": 38.75,
          "en": "It's this wall -- section where we present our main product",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.75,
          "end": 42.69,
          "en": "or in the case of a blog, maybe ourselves.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.69,
          "end": 47.69,
          "en": "So that's this hero section where we present ourselves.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.92,
          "end": 52.51,
          "en": "And then the second part is the Featured Posts section.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.51,
          "end": 56.88,
          "en": "Now we have no posts yet, but we can still start working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.88,
          "end": 60.85,
          "en": "on that and just output some dummy content for the moment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.85,
          "end": 63.43,
          "en": "And we'll then replace the dummy content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 63.43,
          "end": 66.743,
          "en": "with actual posts once we have some.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.7,
          "end": 71.5,
          "en": "So these are the two kinds of things I wanna output here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.5,
          "end": 75.51,
          "en": "and therefore in the component where we returned JSX,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.51,
          "end": 80.06,
          "en": "I wanna have two main sections that will be output here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 80.06,
          "end": 84.52,
          "en": "Now I want to keep my page component relatively lean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 84.52,
          "end": 87.43,
          "en": "and not put too much markup in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 87.43,
          "end": 90.21000000000001,
          "en": "I also don't wanna add a Styling file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 90.21000000000001,
          "end": 92.4,
          "en": "for the page component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.4,
          "end": 94.31,
          "en": "That is something you don't have to do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 94.31,
          "end": 96.21000000000001,
          "en": "but something you will often see,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 96.21000000000001,
          "end": 100.18,
          "en": "that page components are relatively lean focus",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.18,
          "end": 104.56,
          "en": "on getting data with getStaticProps if they need to,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 104.56,
          "end": 106.57,
          "en": "something we will add later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 106.57,
          "end": 111.27000000000001,
          "en": "and don't do too much regarding styling or HTML.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.27000000000001,
          "end": 114.72,
          "en": "Instead we use separate React components for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.72,
          "end": 119.03,
          "en": "and we then just use those separate React components here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.03,
          "end": 120.99,
          "en": "So in the HomePage component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.99,
          "end": 124.37,
          "en": "we could want to output a Hero component side",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 124.37,
          "end": 127.75,
          "en": "by side to a Featured Posts component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.75,
          "end": 132.4,
          "en": "And of course, we would need to wrap this with a fragment.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 132.4,
          "end": 136.25,
          "en": "So with this Fragment component provided by React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.25,
          "end": 138.04,
          "en": "since we're not allowed to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 138.04,
          "end": 141.113,
          "en": "have adjacent JSX elements otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 142.07,
          "end": 143.68,
          "en": "Now of course, such a Hero",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.68,
          "end": 146.77,
          "en": "and Featured Posts component doesn't exist yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.77,
          "end": 150.32999999999998,
          "en": "And hence, it's now our job to create it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.32999999999998,
          "end": 153.86,
          "en": "And therefore I'll add a brand new Components folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 153.86,
          "end": 155.79,
          "en": "on the root project level.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.79,
          "end": 158.84,
          "en": "So side by side to the Pages folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.84,
          "end": 161.68,
          "en": "and the goal of this folder is to store all the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 161.68,
          "end": 166.54,
          "en": "individual components that will be used in this project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 166.54,
          "end": 169.57999999999998,
          "en": "And in here, I'll add a new folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 169.57999999999998,
          "end": 173.48,
          "en": "the HomePage folder, because I wanna store",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 173.48,
          "end": 176.84,
          "en": "the HomePage specific components in there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 176.84,
          "end": 180.043,
          "en": "You can of course name this folder however you want though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 180.9,
          "end": 183.25,
          "en": "But I'll create that HomePage folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 183.25,
          "end": 184.84,
          "en": "in the Components folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 184.84,
          "end": 189.84,
          "en": "And inside of that HomePage folder, I'll add two components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 190.24,
          "end": 195.24,
          "en": "The Hero component, and this Featured Posts component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 196.93,
          "end": 201.3,
          "en": "Now both components will also need some styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 201.3,
          "end": 204.6,
          "en": "And since this is still no CSS course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 204.6,
          "end": 208.89,
          "en": "and I don't wanna bore you with writing CSS styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 208.89,
          "end": 211.51,
          "en": "you find styling files attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 211.51,
          "end": 214.24,
          "en": "Attached you find two CSS files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 214.24,
          "end": 219.05700000000002,
          "en": "featured-posts.module.CSS and hero module.CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 219.9,
          "end": 223.29,
          "en": "And you should just download those two CSS files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 223.29,
          "end": 225.9,
          "en": "and add them in that HomePage folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 225.9,
          "end": 228.48,
          "en": "in the Components folder side-by-side",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 228.48,
          "end": 231.14,
          "en": "to these two JavaScript files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 231.14,
          "end": 233.72,
          "en": "because we're going to use these styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 233.72,
          "end": 237.35,
          "en": "Now, of course you are free to bring your own styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 237.35,
          "end": 239.97,
          "en": "and tweak everything in the way you want.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 239.97,
          "end": 243.21,
          "en": "These are just some basic styles which we can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 243.21,
          "end": 245.863,
          "en": "so that we don't have to write our own styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 246.73,
          "end": 249.46,
          "en": "Now, one important word about those styles though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 249.46,
          "end": 251.5,
          "en": "in there in those files,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 251.5,
          "end": 255.37,
          "en": "I'm using a feature called CSS variables.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 255.37,
          "end": 258.93,
          "en": "I am extracting certain values like colors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 258.93,
          "end": 263.93,
          "en": "but also sizes and dimensions from CSS variables.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 264.72,
          "end": 269.72,
          "en": "And these CSS variables are defined in the Globals CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 270.4,
          "end": 272.7,
          "en": "which I gave you right from the start.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 272.7,
          "end": 274.79,
          "en": "So, which was part of the starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 274.79,
          "end": 276.623,
          "en": "you found in the last lectures.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 277.46,
          "end": 280.44,
          "en": "And the interesting thing about CS modules is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 280.44,
          "end": 284.34000000000003,
          "en": "that we now have one place where we can define",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 284.34000000000003,
          "end": 288.05,
          "en": "and manage our colors and our sizes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 288.05,
          "end": 290.12,
          "en": "And when we change it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 290.12,
          "end": 293.3,
          "en": "it will affect the entire application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 293.3,
          "end": 296.65999999999997,
          "en": "Now this is totally independent from Next.js",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 296.65999999999997,
          "end": 299.39,
          "en": "This is a default CSS feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 299.39,
          "end": 300.75,
          "en": "I'm just using it here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 300.75,
          "end": 302.93,
          "en": "and I want to make you aware of that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 302.93,
          "end": 305.56,
          "en": "in case you look into my CSS files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 305.56,
          "end": 309.35,
          "en": "and wonder what these strange things are.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 309.35,
          "end": 311.25,
          "en": "Now, that means that of course you can also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 311.25,
          "end": 314.82,
          "en": "easily tweak your dimensions and colors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 314.82,
          "end": 319.053,
          "en": "by simply changing the values in the Globals CSS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 320.51,
          "end": 322.14,
          "en": "But with that out of the way, let's go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 322.14,
          "end": 325,
          "en": "to the hero.js file and let's start working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 325,
          "end": 327.773,
          "en": "on that and let's build that Hero component.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
